        <Param val="Visual Search Task&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will see different shapes on the screen.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Your task is to determine whether the red circle is present.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press P if the red circle is present.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press A if the red circle is absent.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Respond as quickly and accurately as possible.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will first complete some practice trials&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to begin." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
